    "id": "def:l8-golay-audit",
    "name": "Primitive eight-period Golay tensor audit",
    "construction": "For \\(L=8\\), \\(\\phi_8(j)=j_0j_1+j_1j_2\\pmod 2\\). Averaging the identity \\[\\prod_{r=1}^{m}W_{j_r}=\\sigma^m(-1)^{\\sum_r\\phi_8(j_r)+\\sum_{k=0}^{2}\\alpha_k(\\bigoplus_r j_r)_k}\\] over uniform \\(\\sigma\\) and \\(\\alpha\\) gives zero for odd \\(m\\), and for even \\(m\\) gives \\(\\mathbf 1\\{\\bigoplus_rj_r=0\\}(-1)^{\\sum_r\\phi_8(j_r)}\\). For \\(\\sigma=1\\), the complete affine-mask audit is \\[\\begin{array}{c|c|c c c}\\alpha_0\\alpha_1\\alpha_2&(W_0,\\ldots,W_7)&C_{8,1}&C_{8,2}&C_{8,3}\\\\\\hline000&(+,+,+,-,+,+,-,+)&-1&0&3\\\\001&(+,+,+,-,-,-,+,-)&1&0&-3\\\\010&(+,+,-,+,+,+,+,-)&1&0&1\\\\011&(+,+,-,+,-,-,-,+)&-1&0&-1\\\\100&(+,-,+,+,+,-,-,-)&1&0&-3\\\\101&(+,-,+,+,-,+,+,+)&-1&0&3\\\\110&(+,-,-,-,+,-,+,+)&-1&0&-1\\\\111&(+,-,-,-,-,+,-,-)&1&0&1\\end{array}\\] and the rows for \\(\\sigma=-1\\) are their global negatives.",
    "free_symbols": [
      "L",
      "phi",
      "W",
      "C"
    ]
  }
}